Primary: none; supporting module is allowed.
Collaborating: EDG-REQ-0003, EDG-REQ-0004, EDG-REQ-0006, EDG-REQ-0009, EDG-REQ-0011, EDG-REQ-0023.
Reserved ports: PORT-COMPUTE (device id, memory budget, clock mode); PORT-POWER (energy sample stream); PORT-LINK (link state, latency sample).
Ports are design-only, not board adapters, not EDG-REQ-0034. Software decomposition belongs to S4; no relocation is authorised in S2.
<<<

