[REQUIREMENT]
UID: EDGE-ARC-OB-REC
TITLE: REC applicable obligations
STATUS: proposed
KIND: obligation table
MODULES: REC
SOURCE: EDG-REQ-0003 EDG-REQ-0004 EDG-REQ-0007 EDG-REQ-0008 EDG-REQ-0009 EDG-REQ-0011 EDG-REQ-0019 EDG-REQ-0027
STATEMENT: >>>
EDG-REQ-0003: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Validate mandatory run metadata. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0004: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Retain raw latency/memory and supported measured energy, with timing boundary and repeat configuration. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0007: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Replay fixed artifacts deterministically; do not re-run inference. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0008: responsible REC (primary); Validate provenance fields and raw artifact references. Every result producer supplies revision, configuration, seed or explicit non-applicability, host, raw artifact and analysis command; no omitted failure records. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0009: responsible REC (primary); Enforce host_type in run records. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0011: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Keep model/profiling acceptance independent of B0 and test without B0 installed. No B0 control dependency for EDGE acceptance; no dependency on B0 results. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0019: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Retain hashes and first-use evidence. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
EDG-REQ-0027: responsible REC (collaborating/applicable); Retain model source, parameters and units. Evidence: record-validator fixtures, rejected records, retained raw artifact references. Check stage: S2 design review; S3 migration compatibility where code exists; S4 module tests; S5 integrated evidence. None executed by this document.
<<<

