[REQUIREMENT]
UID: EDGE-ARC-OB-XC
TITLE: Owner integration accountability for XC
STATUS: proposed
KIND: obligation table
MODULES: XC / Owner
SOURCE: EDG-REQ-0010 EDG-REQ-0011
STATEMENT: >>>
XC is a cross-cutting classification, not a functional module. Responsible integration person: Owner. PA may organise checks and supply evidence but cannot self-approve architecture or scope expansion.
0010: inspect synthetic civil vocabulary/fixtures at S4 and licensed data/application use at S5; evidence is scope inspection plus out-of-scope rejection records (IT-01).
0011: run model and measurement tests in an environment without B0 control modules installed at S5; record environment, dependency inventory, exact commands, outputs and raw artifacts (IT-02). Merely proving imports do not mention B0 is insufficient.
Owner reviews these evidence items before integrated acceptance. Tests are planned, not executed.
<<<

